{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CHARMING MEMORY GAME TO MAKE YOU FALL IN LOVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Find My Love</i></strong> is a beautiful memory game where you must find lovely couples. Different from conventional memory games which you must find two same cards, in this game <strong>no card is equal to anyother.</strong> The game rules is just simple: you must find couples and get points. Find <i>the King and Queen, the Prince and Princess, the Cowboy and Cowgirl, the Groom and Bride...</i> and many other couples that truly loves each other. But be careful! If you flip the <i>bad</i> card twice you lose the game and must restart the level you are. Dont let any evil ideology destroy the pretty love of these couples, find each couple and help then to stay together until death do them part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want play without any worries about flipping the <i>bad</i> card, you can play in\u00a0<strong>Relax Mode,</strong> in this mode there is no <i>bad card</i> on table, you will never lose. Just relax, enjoy the beautiful songs and find the couples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first game of <strong>Araujo Castle Games.</strong> We created beautiful art and a loving atmosphere for you enjoy, relax and have fun while playing <strong>Find My Love.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful images and characters in anime style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/extras/Beautiful_Images.jpg?t=1744374350\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 beautiful backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/extras/Beautiful_Backgrounds.jpg?t=1744374350\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful, happy, relaxing, lovely and romantic songs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>49 cards </strong>in total. 24 male cards, 24 female cards and 1 <i>bad card</i> called &quot;the bad ideologist&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/extras/descricao3.jpg?t=1744374350\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Rules:</strong> Just find the couples and be careful to not flip the <i>bad\u00a0card</i> twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/extras/ohno3dither.gif?t=1744374350\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax Mode:</strong> No <i>bad card</i> on table, just relax and find the couples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/extras/Couplefound3dither.gif?t=1744374350\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 levels</strong> in normal mode. Each level more harder than the previous level, with more cards on table. Can you win all?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 levels in Relax Mode:</strong> Levels with 12 cards, 24 cards and 48 cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u00b4m sure you will fall in love for<strong> Find My Love!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3500080?t=1744374350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/672beb0bf6ca76a78abe84fc4b7a97104ecff775/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744374350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500080/ac3ec7b381e8e93d9ce363ee3cffdc70d6b4438b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744374350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.